          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પથારી (pathārī) is a tadbhava. It comes from Sanskrit prastāra, \"spreading out; bed of straw\", and CDIAL glosses the Gujarati word \"bedding\" (CDIAL 8864)."
            }
